@startuml pyodide_execution_flow
title PySphere - Client-Side Pyodide WASM Execution Flow

actor User
boundary "Monaco Editor (Main Thread)" as Editor
control "Pyodide Worker Hook" as Hook
entity "Web Worker Sandbox" as Worker
database "Pyodide WASM Engine" as Pyodide
boundary "Console / Visualizer UI" as UI
boundary "FastAPI Backend" as Backend

User -> Editor : Types Python Code
Editor -> Hook : Debounced change (every 1.5s)
Hook -> Editor : Saves draft to browser localStorage
Hook -> Backend : POST /api/v1/progress/sync-draft (async non-blocking)

User -> Editor : Clicks "Run Code" / "Submit"
Editor -> Hook : executeCode(code, testCases)
Hook -> UI : Set UI State: RUNNING (spinner/indicator)
Hook -> Worker : postMessage({ type: "EXECUTE", code, testCases })

activate Worker
Worker -> Pyodide : Reset stdout / stderr buffers
Worker -> Pyodide : runPythonAsync(code)
activate Pyodide

alt Normal Execution
    Pyodide --> Worker : Output string (stdout)
    Worker -> Pyodide : Evaluate test cases (if provided)
    Pyodide --> Worker : Assertion results (pass/fail)
    Worker -> Hook : postMessage({ type: "SUCCESS", stdout, stderr, testResults, executionTimeMs })
else Syntax or Runtime Exception
    Pyodide --> Worker : Python Exception Traceback
    Worker -> Hook : postMessage({ type: "ERROR", error: formattedTraceback })
end
deactivate Pyodide
deactivate Worker

Hook -> UI : Render stdout/stderr in Interactive Console
Hook -> UI : Display Test Cases Pass/Fail Badges

alt Code Passed All Test Cases
    Hook -> Backend : POST /api/v1/submissions (code, status: PASSED, time)
    Backend -> Backend : Update User Progress, Add XP (+50), Check Streak
    Backend --> Hook : { xpEarned: 50, currentStreak: 3, newTotalXp: 450 }
    Hook -> UI : Confetti trigger & Streak banner update
end

@enduml
